Thought: The self-contained analysis confirms Barking and Dagenham as the only statistically significant hot spot with a positive Local Moran's I (0.3611) and p < 0.05. No cold spots met the criteria.

FINAL ANSWER: Barking and Dagenham (HH, statistical method=0.3611)

